Let recursive level (n) carry
[
\mathcal C_n
=
-B_n\partial_\lambda^2+K_n,
qquad
\mathcal G_n=\mathcal C_n^{-1}.
]

A mechanics-aware ᚼ may therefore act as
[
\boxed{
ᚼ:\mathcal C_n\rightarrow\mathcal C_{n+1}.
